          "<thought>\nGood! The molecule contains several functional groups including:\n- Tertiary amines\n- Primary amines\n- Halide (alkyl halide)\n- Methoxy groups\n- Various aromatic rings\n\nFor an SN2 reaction in the forward direction:\n- Bonds formed: C-N (carbon-nitrogen)\n- Bonds broken: C-halide (like C-Cl)\n- Functional groups broken: halide\n- Functional groups formed: amine (tertiary amine in this case)\n\nFor the retrosynthetic step (reverse):\n- I need to break a C-N bond\n- Reform a C-halide bond\n- This would disconnect the tertiary amine connection\n\nLet me search for templates that match these criteria. Since we're doing retrosynthesis, I need to think about what happens when we apply the template:\n- In retrosynthesis, we break what was formed in the forward reaction\n- So I should search for templates where in the FORWARD reaction: C-N is formed and C-halide is broken\n</thought>\n\n<action>search_template_catalog_by_criteria</action>\n<action_input>{\n  \"molecule_smiles\": \"COc1cccc(NC(=O)c2nnn(Cc3ccc(CN4CC(F)C4)cc3)c2N)c1\",\n  \"functional_groups_broken\": [\"halide\"],\n  \"functional_groups_formed\": [\"tertiary amines\"],\n  \"bonds_formed\": [\"6-7\"],\n  \"limit\": 20\n}</action_input>": 0.0,
